    <!-- Hero Section for About Us -->
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>Skylook Developers & Constructions: A journey of excellence in real estate and construction.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MD Introduction Section -->
    <section class="md-introduction">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Meet Our Founder & Managing Director</h2>
            <div class="md-photo">
                <img src="assets/images/md-photo.jpg" alt="MD Rajendra Pakki">
            </div>
            <div class="md-bio">
                <p>Skylook Developers & Constructions was founded by MD Rajendra Pakki in 2016. The company initially started as a construction and interior design firm and expanded into real estate in 2019. With a vision to provide quality and affordable properties, we have successfully delivered several residential and commercial projects.</p>
                <p>Our MD, Rajendra Pakki, has been the guiding force behind the company’s growth. With years of experience in the construction industry, his leadership has shaped the company into what it is today. His vision is to provide the best living spaces with excellent customer service, ensuring that every venture fulfills the dreams of its clients.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Company Journey Section -->
    <section class="company-journey">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Our Journey</h2>
            <p>Skylook Developers & Constructions was established in 2016, starting as a construction and interior company. Our expansion into real estate in 2019 marked a significant milestone. We aim to be one of the most trusted developers in Visakhapatnam and its surrounding areas.</p>
            <p>Over the years, we have gained the trust of our clients by delivering top-notch real estate ventures, including VMRDA-approved plots and farmlands. Our focus is on providing transparent and reliable real estate options, always keeping the customer at the center of everything we do.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="main-footer">
        <p>&copy; 2025 Skylook Developers & Constructions | All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- Transparent Logo (Fixed Background) -->
    <div class="background-logo">
        <img src="assets/images/logo.png" alt="Skylook Logo">
    </div>

